{"4331940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TrollMaker", "steam_appid": 4331940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your friends rage in TrollMaker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the most petty and ruthless races!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players build courses using various objects to mess with their friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, hammers, spinning traps, moving platforms…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on how you place obstacles, the race can be completely different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is racing really the goal?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, winning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But…<br><strong><i>Isn’t it more fun to mess with your friends?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>a variety of characters</strong> and use their skills to annoy your friends!<br>An astronaut who drags others,<br>a Santa who throws dangerous gifts,<br>a traffic cop who stuns players with a taser, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create levels, race, and sabotage your friends!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your friends rage in TrollMaker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the most petty and ruthless races!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players build courses using various objects to mess with their friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, hammers, spinning traps, moving platforms…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on how you place obstacles, the race can be completely different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >